Z||000011||ChadMan||08-31-99||07:49 AM||||LowCG, it wasn't a Levi's Gremlin, unfortunately.  It was black with a 304 (?) V8.  The guy claimed it could run 1/4's in the low 15's and I nodded politely, but skeptically.  Still, with its rolling doorstop shape, it was cool.<p>I hate to admit it, but I like Pacers too.  Some cars are just so uncool, they're cool.  I would argue that Beetles and woodies (fake and real) fall into this category.  Now Fieros are just plain cool.
